---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { program } from '../data/program';
// TODO(client): confirm payment, refund and batch-transfer rules, then have this reviewed by your legal advisor.
---

<Legal
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description="Terms for using the Tradot Academy website and enrolling in the stock market trading program."
  updated="10 October 2026"
>
  <p>
    These terms apply to your use of this website and to enrolment in programs run by Tradot Academy, {site.location}.
    By using the website or enrolling, you agree to them.
  </p>

  <h2>Education only</h2>
  <p class="callout">{site.disclaimer}</p>
  <p>
    Our program teaches concepts, methods and risk management. Any examples, chart studies or trades discussed in
    class are for learning only and are not recommendations to buy or sell any security. You are solely responsible
    for your own trading and investment decisions. See our <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a> for more.
  </p>

  <h2>Enrolment and fees</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The current program fee is {program.feeDisplay} for the {program.durationDisplay} program, unless we confirm otherwise in writing.</li>
    <li>Your seat in a batch is confirmed once we receive your fee and confirm your batch.</li>
    <li>Batch dates, timings and mode (online or offline) are shared when you enrol and may change with notice.</li>
    <li>Refund and batch-transfer requests are handled as agreed at the time of enrolment.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Classes and conduct</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Class materials, recordings and resources are for your personal learning only. Do not share, resell or publish them.</li>
    <li>Please be respectful to mentors and other students. We may remove anyone who disrupts classes or misuses batch groups.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Website content</h2>
  <p>
    The text, design, logo and materials on this website belong to Tradot Academy unless stated otherwise. Market news
    headlines belong to their publishers (Moneycontrol and Investing.com) and link to the original articles.
  </p>
  <p>
    We try to keep information on this website accurate and up to date, but we do not guarantee it is complete or
    free from errors.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the extent allowed by law, Tradot Academy is not liable for any trading or investment losses, or for any
    indirect loss, arising from use of this website, our classes or our materials.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India. Courts in Kochi, Kerala have jurisdiction.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms? Call or WhatsApp us at <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a>.</p>
</Legal>
